sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant LoginAPI as /api/auth/login
    participant AuthService
    participant SpringSecurity as AuthenticationManager
    participant JwtService
    
    User->>LoginAPI: POST {email, password}
    LoginAPI->>AuthService: authenticate()
    AuthService->>SpringSecurity: authenticate(email, password)
    SpringSecurity->>SpringSecurity: Verify BCrypt Password
    SpringSecurity-->>AuthService: Authentication Success
    AuthService->>JwtService: generateToken(User)
    JwtService-->>AuthService: JWT String
    AuthService-->>LoginAPI: Token & User Details
    LoginAPI-->>User: HTTP 200 OK (JWT)
    
    Note over User,SpringSecurity: Subsequent Requests
    User->>SpringSecurity: GET /api/customers/me (Header: Bearer JWT)
    SpringSecurity->>JwtService: extractUsername & validateToken
    JwtService-->>SpringSecurity: Valid
    SpringSecurity->>SpringSecurity: Set SecurityContextHolder
    SpringSecurity->>LoginAPI: Forward to Controller
